url: "https://github.com/hefinn-lab/TSRCT-PT100-SSR-PID-Temperature-Controller"
abstract: >-
  TSRCT-PCB-01 is an open-source dual-channel RTD thermal-control platform
  using Arduino Nano Every and MAX31865 front ends, with Pt100/Pt1000
  configuration, 5 V SSR command outputs, non-blocking acquisition, PI/PID
  control, Python logging, and single-step FOPDT/SIMC analytical tuning.
  Hardware is licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0; original software is MIT, with
  Adafruit-derived software retaining its upstream BSD notice.
keywords:
  - temperature control
  - Pt100
  - Pt1000
  - MAX31865
  - RTD
  - SSR
